            "\\end{description}\n",
            "For {\\sf ECtHR (A)}, {\\sf ECtHR (B)}, and {\\sf SCOTUS}, because there exist some issues when running the fp16 setting in our environment, we run the code of~\\citet{IC22b} by using fp32 instead.\n",
