            "\n",
            "Except numbers borrowed from~\\citet{IC22b}, we run five seeds for all BERT experiments and report the mean test performance over all seeds.~\\citet{IC22b} also run five seeds, but their test scores are based on the top three seeds with the best Macro-F1 on validation data.\n",
